00:20:02,010 --> 00:20:10,300
During these 60 minutes, they'll prepare for a meeting, discuss problems, share ideas, solve issues, and make important business decisions.

556
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:15,270
So you'll learn many useful office expressions and practical meeting vocabulary.

557
00:20:15,790 --> 00:20:16,530
I'll wait, everyone.

558
00:20:16,750 --> 00:20:18,830
Let's begin today's conversation practice.

559
00:20:18,850 --> 00:20:20,970
8 a.m. Monday morning.

560
00:20:21,310 --> 00:20:22,210
Good morning, Ethan.

561
00:20:22,270 --> 00:20:23,530
You're here early today.

562
00:20:24,050 --> 00:20:24,650
Morning, Chloe.

563
00:20:24,950 --> 00:20:27,450
Yeah, I wanted to prepare before the client meeting starts.

564
