856
00:32:00,360 --> 00:32:01,660
That's excellent progress.

857
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:04,700
Customer engagement also improved significantly.

858
00:32:05,100 --> 00:32:05,600
Great news.

859
00:32:06,060 --> 00:32:08,220
However, we still face a few challenges.

860
00:32:08,780 --> 00:32:09,200
Such as?

861
00:32:09,660 --> 00:32:13,270
Project delays and communication issues between departments.

862
00:32:13,290 --> 00:32:14,290
I've noticed that too.

863
00:32:14,770 --> 00:32:16,490
Especially during large projects.

864
00:32:16,990 --> 00:32:18,840
Better coordination would definitely help.

865
00:32:19,300 --> 00:32:19,660
Agreed.

866
