867
00:32:23,480 --> 00:32:23,840
Thank you.

868
00:32:24,260 --> 00:32:26,620
Our latest campaign performed better than expected.

869
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:27,870
That's wonderful.

870
00:32:27,980 --> 00:32:30,300
Social media engagement increased by 40%.

871
00:32:30,600 --> 00:32:31,730
Impressive.

872
00:32:32,170 --> 00:32:35,410
Website traffic also grew rapidly after the campaign launch.

873
00:32:35,830 --> 00:32:37,600
