874
00:32:38,150 --> 00:32:40,720
Video advertisements and influencer partnerships.

875
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:41,680
Interesting.

876
00:32:42,040 --> 00:32:44,990
Customers responded positively to authentic content.

877
00:32:45,430 --> 00:32:46,110
That makes sense.

878
00:32:46,590 --> 00:32:50,010
We also improved communication with customers through live chat support.

879
00:32:50,430 --> 00:32:51,150
Excellent idea.

880
00:32:51,640 --> 00:32:54,460
Faster responses improved customer satisfaction.

881
00:32:54,610 --> 00:32:56,610
Were there any difficulties during the campaign?

882
00:32:57,090 --> 00:32:57,410
Yes.

883
00:32:57,970 --> 00:32:59,010
What kind of difficulties?

884
00:32:59,470 --> 00:33:01,140
The team faced tight deadlines.

885
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:03,180
That can create a lot of pressure.

886
00:33:03,520 --> 00:33:04,080
Definitely.

887
00:33:04,520 --> 00:33:05,600
How did the team handle it?

888
00:33:05,980 --> 00:33:08,680
We scheduled shorter daily meetings to track progress.

889
00:33:09,150 --> 00:33:09,710
Did that help?

890
00:33:10,170 --> 00:33:10,670
Very much.

891
00:33:11,150 --> 00:33:12,690
Communication became more efficient?

892
00:33:13,070 --> 00:33:13,550
Exactly.

893
00:33:13,970 --> 00:33:14,490
Great work.

894
00:33:14,850 --> 00:33:15,210
Thank you.

895
