906
00:33:36,540 --> 00:33:37,230
That's important.

907
00:33:37,700 --> 00:33:39,960
Sometimes strategic investment is necessary.

908
00:33:40,320 --> 00:33:40,680
I agree.

909
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:43,940
Still, we should monitor expenses carefully next quarter.

910
00:33:44,360 --> 00:33:44,840
