Not officially.

930
00:34:21,260 --> 00:34:23,070
We should communicate with them immediately.

931
00:34:23,110 --> 00:34:23,990
I agree.

932
00:34:24,410 --> 00:34:25,930
Clients appreciate transparency.

933
00:34:26,370 --> 00:34:26,890
Exactly.

934
00:34:27,290 --> 00:34:30,860
We should explain the situation clearly and provide a revised timeline.

935
00:34:31,260 --> 00:34:33,320
I'll prepare a detailed report this afternoon.

936
00:34:33,700 --> 00:34:34,140
Perfect.

937
00:34:34,580 --> 00:34:36,740
All right, everyone, let's take a short coffee break.

938
00:34:37,210 --> 00:34:37,590
Finally.

939
00:34:38,010 --> 00:34:39,330
