951
00:34:54,170 --> 00:34:54,870
That takes time.

952
00:34:55,290 --> 00:34:55,790
Exactly.

953
00:34:56,210 --> 00:34:57,910
Do you enjoy training new employees?

954
00:34:58,320 --> 00:34:59,100
Honestly, yes.

955
00:34:59,600 --> 00:34:59,880
Really?

956
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:02,640
I like helping people feel comfortable in the workplace.

957
00:35:03,100 --> 00:35:03,800
That's important.

958
00:35:04,180 --> 00:35:06,080
Starting a new job can feel overwhelming.

959
00:35:06,580 --> 00:35:07,200
Very true.

960
00:35:07,500 --> 00:35:08,010
What about you?

961
00:35:08,470 --> 00:35:09,970
I enjoy mentoring people, too.

962
00:35:10,370 --> 00:35:12,110
Good leaders support their teams.

963
00:35:12,160 --> 00:35:12,860
Absolutely.

964
00:35:13,240 --> 00:35:15,740
By the way, congratulations on your recent promotion.

965
00:35:16,140 --> 00:35:16,500
Thank you.

966
00:35:16,840 --> 00:35:17,400
How does it feel?

967
00:35:17,820 --> 00:35:19,680
Exciting, but also challenging.

968
00:35:20,100 --> 00:35:21,180
More responsibilities?

969
00:35:21,670 --> 00:35:22,350
A lot more.

970
00:35:22,850 --> 00:35:23,490
I can imagine.

971
00:35:23,970 --> 00:35:26,150
Now I attend meetings almost all day.

972
00:35:26,210 --> 00:35:27,810
Welcome to management.

973
00:35:27,830 --> 00:35:30,690
Honestly, I miss having quiet work time sometimes.

974
00:35:31,110 --> 00:35:32,510
That happens to many managers.

975
00:35:33,020 --> 00:35:36,080
Still, I enjoy leading projects and helping the team succeed.

976
00:35:36,520 --> 00:35:37,460
That's a great attitude.

977
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:39,400
All right, looks like the break is over.

978
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:40,480
Time to continue.

979
00:35:40,820 --> 00:35:41,940
Welcome back, everyone.

980
00:35:42,060 --> 00:35:44,520
Let's continue with the next agenda item.

981
00:35:44,540 --> 00:35:47,370
