I reviewed my notes twice already this morning.

1112
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:38,120
That's a good habit.

1113
00:41:38,480 --> 00:41:40,470
Preparation makes meetings less stressful.

1114
00:41:40,910 --> 00:41:41,410
Exactly.

1115
