I think there's too much information.

1120
00:41:50,710 --> 00:41:52,380
That happens a lot with presentations.

1121
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:53,300
Yeah.

1122
00:41:53,480 --> 00:41:55,780
I want it to look professional, but still simple.

1123
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:58,590
Maybe use fewer words and add more visuals.

1124
00:41:59,010 --> 00:41:59,530
Good idea.

1125
